Package: pipx
Version: 1.18.1-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ticktessly <246650556+ticktessly@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python, python-pip
Section: python
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/pypa/pipx
Description: Install and run Python applications in isolated environments
 pipx installs Python CLIs (yt-dlp, black, gallery-dl, ...) into
 isolated venvs and exposes their binaries on PATH. Drop-in return
 of the package removed from upstream Termux repos.
